' A v1.2 game with Modern opponents (`preset classic ai modern seed 15`),
' watched from Stove Vent as in v12_amiga_full. The same twelve days, but the sixth ends with a save asked for while the opponents' turns are due. It is refused, and the game must end as v12_modern_wait_full does.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 354,317         ' in
